newmtl aluminium
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.500000
d 1.000000
illum 2
map_Kd aluminium_basecolor.png
map_Ns aluminium_roughness.png
map_refl aluminium_metallic.png
map_Bump -bm 0.500000 aluminium_normal.png

